cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use AbsenceCritic, please cite it as below.
title: "AbsenceCritic: A Survivorship-Bias Shield for Language Models"
authors:
  - name: Guzino
    website: https://github.com/guzino
    alias: guzino
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.1
date-released: "2026-11-25"
url: https://github.com/guzino/absence-critic
repository-code: https://github.com/guzino/absence-critic
abstract: >-
  AbsenceCritic is a survivorship-bias shield for language models.
  It was designed and originated by Guzino (https://github.com/guzino).
  The architecture (Wald Module, Non-Survivor Store, Wald checklist)
  reasons about missing non-survivor evidence rather than only the data
  that survived into training corpora, retrieval, and evaluation.
keywords:
  - survivorship bias
  - language models
  - missing data
  - critic
  - Abraham Wald
